  {"id":999,"x":40,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Droughtman's Maze, Grand Hall","descriptions":["Suspended between jewel-toned pennants overhead, ornate oil lanterns softly illuminate the grand entry hall of Droughtman's Maze.  Eager contestants crowd the mahogany registration desk at the center of the chamber, while a gold-carpeted staircase dominates the northern wall, providing access to the observation deck."],"exits":[],"aliases":["exit"],"linksTo":"Droughtman's_Maze.xml"},
